Hi everyone

The 《逐鹿》EA version  welcomes a new update (1.6.16), let's  see the content of this update~

The main updates are as follows:

1. Chang'an and Luoyang will use the newly made "Jingshi" modeling to bring better visual effects; At the same time, the concept of the main city is comprehensively optimized, according to historical and geographical factors, different main city complexes will have different numerical dimensions and have their own characteristics;
[img]https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/42499535/3509f527c8c44161c63650f60556fdac983161bd.png[/img]
2. The addition of the position of "guard" in Fuguan Port can open up the active attack capability (1 block) and improve the counterattack effect;
[img]https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/42499535/4a76ab51e43b6d08eb43d0e868423e903fcf3eaf.png[/img]
3. Add the function that you can "recommend more" after exploring "recommended";
[img]https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/42499535/4493c017715a7dd6d52a119756eba3fd7c3dbeab.png[/img]

[img]https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/42499535/377e722eaefd8be49249ea146e8d4052e72bc909.png[/img]

[img]https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/42499535/a415c1ccbc2e34a220c6525024e497523f130c43.png[/img]
4. Optimize the display entrance of the script configuration when creating the script;
[img]https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/42499535/7acfacaf6269b2c9b7a991c8238187cf074e4b50.png[/img]
5. Add shortcuts to rewards and awards in the list of military generals;
[img]https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/42499535/1ba631c772ed19d35b3a9351967dfaeda5315e34.png[/img]
6. Add shortcut functions that can use the right mouse button to perform return and shutdown;
7. Optimize AI algorithms, and improve the active landing of AI forces;
8. Optimize the AI army and increase the active supply capability during the march;

The above is the content of this update, in the future, we will continue to work hard to continue to develop and optimize more content, so that 《逐鹿》 becomes more perfect, and welcome all the lords to give more valuable suggestions so that we can do better together.
